{{ spec.info.title }} tools for Claude Code. This plugin packages {{ spec.info.title }} SDK skills, the hosted {{ spec.info.title }} MCP server, and deployment commands in Claude Code's native plugin format.

## Installation

The plugin is listed in Anthropic's official marketplace, which Claude Code adds automatically. Install it from your shell:

```sh
claude plugin install {{ name }}@claude-plugins-official
```

Or from a Claude Code session:

```text
/plugin install {{ name }}@claude-plugins-official
```

To install from this repository instead, add it as a marketplace first:

```text
/plugin marketplace add {{ sdk.gitUserName }}/{{ sdk.gitRepoName }}
/plugin install {{ name }}@{{ name }}
```

Run `/reload-plugins` to load the plugin in a session that is already open.

